# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every OS. Raw string literals take the line endings of their source
# file, so a CRLF checkout on Windows used to change what tests compare (see #127). The signed test vectors keep their
# exact bytes: tests/A2A.Tests/Vectors/.gitattributes turns conversion off there.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Most pull requests add lines to these lists, so a merge keeps the lines of both sides. The API analyzers do not need an order.
**/PublicAPI.Shipped.txt merge=union
**/PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt merge=union
